                {
                  "collectionType": "chain",
                  "id": "recruit_post_style_lowkey",
                  "title": "招聘口径：低调试水",
                  "trigger_mode": "invoke",
                  "trigger_expr": "",
                  "invoke_params": [],
                  "object_keys": [
                    "player"
                  ],
                  "location": "job_agency_linh",
                  "presentation": {
                    "type": "dialogue",
                    "dialogues": [
                      {
                        "speaker_type": "player",
                        "speaker_key": "player",
                        "content": "“短期招聘一位事务协助，工作弹性，先合作看看，合适再长期安排。”"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker_type": "player",
                        "speaker_key": "player",
                        "content": "这种写法很稳，不容易招来太多闲话，但也容易让人觉得你还没想明白要做什么。"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "init_script": "",
                  "end_script": "// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“低调试水”招聘口径，保留谨慎起步的团队搭建风格。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 当前关注度基线。\n// 计算规则：低调路线外界关注度最低，但也会让优秀应聘者怀疑岗位稳定性，因此 first_impression 先写为 0，表示中性偏观望。\n// 写回变量：style=3，attention 不增加，first_impression 设为中性；阶段保持已发布，并标记已发布招聘。\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 3\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 0\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = 0\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_hours=2",
                  "next": [],
                  "bgm": ""
                },
                {
