                  "init_script": "",
                  "end_script": "// 规则目的：玩家选择立刻沟通，体现效率导向，并调度初聊节点。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_stage} 用于确认流程已进入收到应聘阶段。\n// 计算规则：response_style 约定为 1立刻沟通、2先看履历、3暂缓处理。立刻沟通会让助理觉得玩家执行快。\n// 写回变量：写入 response_style=1，并直接调度初聊事件。\n${player.team_recruit_response_style} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)\ninvoke_once chain recruit_zhuli_first_chat",
                  "next": [],
                  "bgm": ""
                },
                {
                  "collectionType": "chain",
                  "id": "recruit_zhuli_check_resume",
                  "title": "先看履历",
                  "trigger_mode": "invoke",
                  "trigger_expr": "",
                  "invoke_params": [],
                  "object_keys": [
                    "player"
                  ],
                  "location": "job_agency_linh",
                  "presentation": {
                    "type": "dialogue",
                    "dialogues": [
                      {
                        "speaker_type": "player",
                        "speaker_key": "player",
                        "content": "你先把她的履历从头到尾看了一遍。"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker_type": "player",
                        "speaker_key": "player",
                        "content": "做过前台，也跟过小项目，最重要的是，字里行间透着一股会办事的利索劲。"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker_type": "player",
                        "speaker_key": "player",
                        "content": "看完之后，你才回了她一句。"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "init_script": "",
                  "end_script": "// 规则目的：玩家先看履历再沟通，体现谨慎与专业感，并调度初聊节点。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} 允许被轻度修正；${player.team_recruit_stage} 用于确认流程阶段。\n// 计算规则：先看履历会让助理感到玩家不是乱招人，因此若初始印象偏负，可轻微拉回；同时进入初聊节点。\n// 写回变量：response_style=2；若 first_impression 小于 1，则加 1；随后调度初聊。\n${player.team_recruit_response_style} = 2\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)\nif (${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} < 1) {\n  ${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = ${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} + 1\n}\ninvoke_once chain recruit_zhuli_first_chat",
                  "next": [],
                  "bgm": ""
                },
                {
                  "collectionType": "chain",
                  "id": "recruit_zhuli_hold",
                  "title": "暂缓处理",
                  "trigger_mode": "invoke",
                  "trigger_expr": "",
                  "invoke_params": [],
                  "object_keys": [
                    "player"
                  ],
                  "location": "job_agency_linh",
                  "presentation": {
                    "type": "dialogue",
                    "dialogues": [
                      {
                        "speaker_type": "player",
                        "speaker_key": "player",
                        "content": "你把这条应聘消息先搁在一边。"
