            "logs": [
              {
                "role": "chiefEditor",
                "title": "总主编",
                "summary": "已识别本次反馈的真实诉求不是剧情内容不足，而是事件结构落点不对：当前草稿把一批本应属于支线玩法与调用节点的招聘事件放进了 chain。根据项目规则，pool 并不等于随机杂项，很多一次性、阶段性、由脚本调用的事件更适合放在 pool，尤其是 trigger_mode=invoke 的节点。\n\n已确认应优先保留的资产包括：现有招聘相关 id、`player.team_recruit_*` / `player.team_zhuli_*` 变量体系、所有已有非空脚本、`job_agency_linh` 与 `office_interview_room` 地点、`important:zhuli` 角色引用，以及“次日收到应聘”的延时设计。\n\n已确认应重构的部分包括：\n- 事件归属：把过多的 chain 事件改挂到 pool；\n- 承接方式：减少通过 chain.next 表现的伪线性流程，改用 doing 入口 + invoke 调度；\n- 可玩性结构：让玩家主动发布、主动跟进，而不是让系统像小说章节一样一段段推着走。\n\n已确认不应修改的部分包括：\n- 不清空已有非空脚本；\n- 不新造同义变量；\n- 不把 calc 变量当可写；\n- 不把招聘线强行并回开局主线链。"
              },
              {
                "role": "plotPlanner",
                "title": "剧情规划",
                "summary": "{\n  \"title\": \"助理加入改造：主动招聘链路\",\n  \"summary\": \"本批修订处理招聘节奏反馈：第一天发布招聘，第二天才收到助理应聘，使县城招聘链路更符合现实时间感，也为玩家保留第一天发布后的观察窗口。结构上将招聘发布、候选人出现、响应方式、初聊姿态、录用判断统一改为平面事件池中的 invoke 事件；主线 chain 不再承载这批支线玩法。与此同时补齐主动入口 doing，保证迁移到 pool 后仍然可玩。\",\n  \"arc\": \"开局第一天·主动招聘助理\",\n  \"locations\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"job_agency_linh\",\n      \"descr\": \"县城里常见的招聘服务门店，玻璃门上贴着招工信息，柜台后摆着老旧电脑和打印机。可用于主角线下发布招聘、查看简历、与应聘者初次见面，兼容后续招司机、招财务、招保镖等团队招聘玩法。\",\n      \"prompt\": \"small county job agency interior in China, glass door with hiring posters, old desktop computers, printer, front desk, realistic modern county town atmosphere, modest office, daytime\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"office_interview_room\",\n      \"descr\": \"主角临时用于面试和谈工作的办公室小会议室，比 office_small 更偏接待用途，有一张会议桌、两三把椅子和热水杯，适合招聘初谈、试岗沟通和后续团队小型复盘。\",\n      \"prompt\": \"small interview meeting room in a modest county office, simple conference table, a few chairs, water cups, bright indoor lighting, realistic contemporary China county business style\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"roles\": [],\n  \"items\": [],\n  \"doing\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"do_recruit_zhuli_post\",\n      \"title\": \"去招聘点发布助理岗位\",\n      \"desc\": \"去县城招聘门店挂岗位，决定你想招一个什么风格的助理。\",\n      \"location\": \"job_agency_linh\",\n      \"visible_expr\": \"!${player.team_recruit_posted}\",\n      \"actions\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"post_high\",\n          \"text\": \"高调撒钱\",\n          \"exec_script\": \"// 规则目的：主动入口只负责把玩家送进对应招聘发布事件，不在这里重复写状态变量。\\n// 读取变量：无额外读取。\\n// 计算规则：发布招聘的具体状态写回集中在目标事件 end_script 中，避免入口和事件重复写值。\\n// 写回变量：无，直接调用发布事件。\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_post_style_high\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"post_regular\",\n          \"text\": \"务实正规\",\n          \"exec_script\": \"// 规则目的：主动入口只负责把玩家送进对应招聘发布事件，不在这里重复写状态变量。\\n// 读取变量：无额外读取。\\n// 计算规则：发布招聘的具体状态写回集中在目标事件 end_script 中，避免入口和事件重复写值。\\n// 写回变量：无，直接调用发布事件。\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_post_style_regular\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"post_lowkey\",\n          \"text\": \"低调试水\",\n          \"exec_script\": \"// 规则目的：主动入口只负责把玩家送进对应招聘发布事件，不在这里重复写状态变量。\\n// 读取变量：无额外读取。\\n// 计算规则：发布招聘的具体状态写回集中在目标事件 end_script 中，避免入口和事件重复写值。\\n// 写回变量：无，直接调用发布事件。\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_post_style_lowkey\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"do_recruit_zhuli_followup\",\n      \"title\": \"跟进助理应聘\",\n      \"desc\": \"查看招聘后的回信与候选人状态，决定下一步要不要聊。\",\n      \"location\": \"job_agency_linh\",\n      \"visible_expr\": \"${player.team_recruit_posted}\",\n      \"actions\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"followup_check\",\n          \"text\": \"查看最新回信\",\n          \"exec_script\": \"// 规则目的：提供招聘发布后的主动跟进入口。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_zhuli_application_received} 判断是否已经收到候选人；${player.team_recruit_stage} 判断当前流程位置。\\n// 计算规则：若已收到首份应聘，则进入回应选择；若尚未收到，则只保留观察窗口，不强行推进。\\n// 写回变量：无直接写回，按状态调用不同事件。\\nif (${player.team_zhuli_application_received}) {\\n  invoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application\\n}\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"events\": [\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_post_style_high\",\n      \"title\": \"招聘口径：高调撒钱\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"job_agency_linh\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"“高薪急招助理，效率第一，待遇不设上限，能立刻到岗最好。”\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"这话一发出去，像是在招人，也像是在告诉全县——${term.player.self_proud}有钱，而且很急着把摊子铺开。\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"\",\n      \"end_script\": \"// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“高调撒钱”招聘口径，形成后续助理对玩家的第一层预判，并把应聘反馈延后到次日出现。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 作为当前关注度基线。\\n// 计算规则：高调路线会提升招聘关注度，也更容易让应聘者先入为主地觉得玩家像暴发户老板，因此 first_impression 先写为 -1。\\n// 写回变量：style=1，attention 增加，first_impression 设为偏负面但可被后续聊天修正；阶段保持为已发布，并标记已发布招聘；应聘消息改为次日触发，同时开放后续查看入口。\\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 1\\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 2\\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = -1\\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\\ndoing_unlock(\\\"do_recruit_zhuli_followup\\\")\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_days=1\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_post_style_regular\",\n      \"title\": \"招聘口径：务实正规\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"job_agency_linh\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"“招聘助理一名，负责日程、对接、资料整理与事务跟进。薪资面议，流程规范，能长期配合优先。”\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"这份文案不花哨，但看起来像真准备做事。\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"\",\n      \"end_script\": \"// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“务实正规”招聘口径，让助理后续更容易把玩家视为靠谱雇主，并把应聘反馈延后到次日出现。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 作为当前关注度基线。\\n// 计算规则：务实路线关注度适中，能给应聘者较稳定、较专业的第一感受，因此 first_impression 先写为 1。\\n// 写回变量：style=2，attention 小幅增加，first_impression 设为偏正面，并标记已发布招聘；应聘消息改为次日触发，同时开放后续查看入口。\\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 2\\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 1\\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = 1\\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\\ndoing_unlock(\\\"do_recruit_zhuli_followup\\\")\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_days=1\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_post_style_lowkey\",\n      \"title\": \"招聘口径：低调试水\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"job_agency_linh\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"“短期招聘一位事务协助，工作弹性，先合作看看，合适再长期安排。”\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"这种写法很稳，不容易招来太多闲话，但也容易让人觉得你还没想明白要做什么。\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"\",\n      \"end_script\": \"// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“低调试水”招聘口径，保留谨慎起步的团队搭建风格，并把应聘反馈延后到次日出现。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 当前关注度基线。\\n// 计算规则：低调路线外界关注度最低，但也会让优秀应聘者怀疑岗位稳定性，因此 first_impression 先写为 0，表示中性偏观望。\\n// 写回变量：style=3，attention 不增加，first_impression 设为中性；阶段保持已发布，并标记已发布招聘；应聘消息改为次日触发，同时开放后续查看入口。\\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 3\\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 0\\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = 0\\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\\ndoing_unlock(\\\"do_recruit_zhuli_followup\\\")\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_days=1\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_zhuli_application\",\n      \"title\": \"第二天收到一份亮眼应聘\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\",\n        \"important:zhuli\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"job_agency_linh\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"第二天再打开招聘后台时，一条新应聘消息安静地躺在最上面。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"应聘者的简历利落，履历不算夸张，但一看就不是那种只会端茶倒水的花架子。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"备注里只有一句话：‘如果岗位是真的，今天方便聊聊。’\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"actions\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": \"reply_now\",\n            \"text\": \"立刻沟通\",\n            \"exec_script\": \"// 规则目的：把收到应聘后的选择分流到独立响应事件。\\n// 读取变量：无额外读取。\\n// 计算规则：具体状态写回在目标响应事件中完成。\\n// 写回变量：无，直接调用事件。\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_reply_now\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"id\": \"check_resume\",\n            \"text\": \"先看履历\",\n            \"exec_script\": \"// 规则目的：把收到应聘后的选择分流到独立响应事件。\\n// 读取变量：无额外读取。\\n// 计算规则：具体状态写回在目标响应事件中完成。\\n// 写回变量：无，直接调用事件。\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_check_resume\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"id\": \"hold\",\n            \"text\": \"暂缓处理\",\n            \"exec_script\": \"// 规则目的：把收到应聘后的选择分流到独立响应事件。\\n// 读取变量：无额外读取。\\n// 计算规则：具体状态写回在目标响应事件中完成。\\n// 写回变量：无，直接调用事件。\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_hold\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"// 规则目的：在招聘发布后的第二天收到助理的应聘消息，只负责把“出现候选人”这一步明确落地，不直接写死录用。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_posted} 确认招聘已发布；${player.team_recruit_stage} 判断当前流程是否已进入候选阶段；${player.team_zhuli_application_received} 用于防止重复收取同一份首轮应聘。\\n// 计算规则：该事件仅由上游招聘发布节点以 delay_days=1 调度；只有在已发布招聘且尚未收到过该候选人消息时，才推进到“已收到应聘”。\\n// 写回变量：把阶段推进到 2，并记录助理已进入招聘流程。\\nif (${player.team_recruit_posted} && !${player.team_zhuli_application_received}) {\\n  ${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)\\n  ${player.team_zhuli_application_received} = true\\n}\",\n      \"end_script\": \"\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_zhuli_reply_now\",\n      \"title\": \"立刻沟通\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"job_agency_linh\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"你没多想，直接点开对话框。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"‘可以，现在聊。’\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"\",\n      \"end_script\": \"// 规则目的：玩家选择立刻沟通，体现效率导向，并调度初聊节点。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_stage} 用于确认流程已进入收到应聘阶段。\\n// 计算规则：response_style 约定为 1立刻沟通、2先看履历、3暂缓处理。立刻沟通会让助理觉得玩家执行快。\\n// 写回变量：写入 response_style=1，并直接调度初聊事件。\\n${player.team_recruit_response_style} = 1\\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_first_chat\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_zhuli_check_resume\",\n      \"title\": \"先看履历\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"job_agency_linh\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"你先把她的履历从头到尾看了一遍。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"做过前台，也跟过小项目，最重要的是，字里行间透着一股会办事的利索劲。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"看完之后，你才回了她一句。\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"\",\n      \"end_script\": \"// 规则目的：玩家先看履历再沟通，体现谨慎与专业感，并调度初聊节点。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} 允许被轻度修正；${player.team_recruit_stage} 用于确认流程阶段。\\n// 计算规则：先看履历会让助理感到玩家不是乱招人，因此若初始印象偏负，可轻微拉回；同时进入初聊节点。\\n// 写回变量：response_style=2；若 first_impression 小于 1，则加 1；随后调度初聊。\\n${player.team_recruit_response_style} = 2\\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)\\nif (${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} < 1) {\\n  ${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = ${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} + 1\\n}\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_first_chat\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_zhuli_hold\",\n      \"title\": \"暂缓处理\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"job_agency_linh\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"你把这条应聘消息先搁在一边。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"人就在这儿，不急着今天拍板。真想做事的人，不会因为几个小时就跑。\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"\",\n      \"end_script\": \"// 规则目的：允许玩家暂缓处理，不把招聘链路强制推到底，同时保留后续再次联系空间。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_stage} 当前阶段；${player.team_zhuli_application_received} 记录候选人已出现。\\n// 计算规则：暂缓处理只记录玩家态度，不直接推进初聊，给导演和玩家留下下一步空间。\\n// 写回变量：response_style=3，阶段保持在已收到应聘，不额外改写印象。\\n${player.team_recruit_response_style} = 3\\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_zhuli_first_chat\",\n      \"title\": \"和助理线上初聊\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\",\n        \"important:zhuli\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"office_interview_room\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"important_role\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"important:zhuli\",\n            \"content\": \"‘岗位我大致看过了。您这边如果真想做事，我可以先接一段时间，看配合。’\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"她没有故作热情，反而问得很细，像是在先判断你值不值得她过来。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"actions\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": \"chat_bold\",\n            \"text\": \"爽快拍板\",\n            \"exec_script\": \"// 规则目的：把初聊中的管理姿态分流到独立事件。\\n// 读取变量：无额外读取。\\n// 计算规则：具体变量变化在目标事件中写回。\\n// 写回变量：无，直接调用事件。\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_chat_bold\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"id\": \"chat_rules\",\n            \"text\": \"讲清规则\",\n            \"exec_script\": \"// 规则目的：把初聊中的管理姿态分流到独立事件。\\n// 读取变量：无额外读取。\\n// 计算规则：具体变量变化在目标事件中写回。\\n// 写回变量：无，直接调用事件。\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_chat_rules\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"id\": \"chat_trial\",\n            \"text\": \"先试用一天\",\n            \"exec_script\": \"// 规则目的：把初聊中的管理姿态分流到独立事件。\\n// 读取变量：无额外读取。\\n// 计算规则：具体变量变化在目标事件中写回。\\n// 写回变量：无，直接调用事件。\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_chat_trial\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"// 规则目的：把招聘流程推进到正式初聊，但不在此处替玩家决定管理风格。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_response_style} 识别玩家是立刻沟通还是先看履历后沟通；${player.team_recruit_stage} 作为流程阶段基线。\\n// 计算规则：初聊事件本身只确认流程已进入沟通阶段，具体第一印象修正交给后续三种姿态事件。\\n// 写回变量：将阶段推进到 3，表示已完成初步接触。\\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 3)\",\n      \"end_script\": \"\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_zhuli_chat_bold\",\n      \"title\": \"沟通姿态：爽快拍板\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\",\n        \"important:zhuli\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"office_interview_room\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"‘行，你来。我不喜欢磨蹭，事办好，待遇不会差。’\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"important_role\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"important:zhuli\",\n            \"content\": \"她看了你两秒，像是在确认你这份痛快到底是底气，还是一时上头。\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"\",\n      \"end_script\": \"// 规则目的：记录玩家在初聊中表现出的爽快拍板风格。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} 作为当前印象基线；${player.team_recruit_attention} 反映岗位本身外界热度。\\n// 计算规则：爽快拍板会强化‘出手痛快’的感受，若前面已是高调路线，这种风格既可能加分也会保留一点冒险感，因此这里只做小幅正向修正。\\n// 写回变量：manage_style=1，first_impression +1，并推进到已完成初聊后的待判断阶段。\\n${player.team_manage_style} = 1\\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = ${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} + 1\\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 4)\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_hire_decision\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_zhuli_chat_rules\",\n      \"title\": \"沟通姿态：讲清规则\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\",\n        \"important:zhuli\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"office_interview_room\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"‘待遇和事都能谈清楚，但我先把规矩说前头：口风要紧，事情要准。’\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"important_role\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"important:zhuli\",\n            \"content\": \"她点了点头，这种话她明显更听得进去。\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"\",\n      \"end_script\": \"// 规则目的：记录玩家在初聊中展现出的规则感与管理边界。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} 当前印象基线。\\n// 计算规则：讲清规则最符合助理岗位对稳定性和边界感的需求，因此给出相对更稳的正向修正。\\n// 写回变量：manage_style=2，first_impression +2，并推进到已完成初聊后的待判断阶段。\\n${player.team_manage_style} = 2\\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = ${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} + 2\\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 4)\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_hire_decision\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_zhuli_chat_trial\",\n      \"title\": \"沟通姿态：先试用一天\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\",\n        \"important:zhuli\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"office_interview_room\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"‘先别急着定长期。你先跟我跑一天，彼此顺手了再说。’\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"important_role\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"important:zhuli\",\n            \"content\": \"她笑了笑，像是觉得这个提议更像真做事的人。\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"\",\n      \"end_script\": \"// 规则目的：记录玩家采取先试用一天的谨慎合作姿态。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} 当前印象基线。\\n// 计算规则：试用一天会降低双方承诺成本，适合县城第一天刚搭班子的节奏，因此给中等幅度正向修正，但不直接等于正式录用。\\n// 写回变量：manage_style=3，first_impression +1，并推进到已完成初聊后的待判断阶段。\\n${player.team_manage_style} = 3\\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = ${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} + 1\\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 4)\\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_hire_decision\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"collectionType\": \"pool\",\n      \"id\": \"recruit_zhuli_hire_decision\",\n      \"title\": \"录用判断\",\n      \"trigger_mode\": \"invoke\",\n      \"trigger_expr\": \"\",\n      \"invoke_params\": [],\n      \"object_keys\": [\n        \"player\",\n        \"important:zhuli\"\n      ],\n      \"location\": \"office_interview_room\",\n      \"presentation\": {\n        \"type\": \"dialogue\",\n        \"dialogues\": [\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"player\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"player\",\n            \"content\": \"这次沟通之后，你已经大概知道她能不能用，但要不要现在就定下来，还是你的事。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"speaker_type\": \"important_role\",\n            \"speaker_key\": \"important:zhuli\",\n            \"content\": \"她也没催，只把联系方式和一个可到岗时间留给了你。\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"init_script\": \"// 规则目的：把招聘流程推进到“可做录用决定”的状态，但不替玩家直接锁死长期结果。\\n// 读取变量：${player.team_manage_style} 识别玩家采用的管理姿态；${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} 汇总候选人目前对玩家的感受；${player.team_recruit_stage} 作为流程阶段。\\n// 计算规则：此节点不是强制录用，只是把招聘流程推进到待决定状态；若前面已经完成初聊，则允许后续导演或新入口继续承接。\\n// 写回变量：把阶段推进到 4，表示已完成初聊并进入待决定阶段，不直接写成 5。\\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 4)\",\n      \"end_script\": \"\",\n      \"next\": [],\n      \"bgm\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"本批不新增变量，完全复用现有 player.team_recruit_* 与 player.team_zhuli_* value 变量。\",\n    \"所有招聘相关事件均迁到 pool，但继续保持 trigger_mode=invoke，只供 doing 或脚本调用，不参与普通调度。\",\n    \"不再给 recruit_zhuli_first_chat 配置线性 next；分支由 presentation.actions 内脚本调用到三个姿态事件。\",\n    \"第一天发布、第二天收到应聘的时间感保留不变；对 calc 变量仅读取，不写入。\"\n  ]\n}"
              },
