        "draft": {
          "title": "助理加入改造：主动招聘链路",
          "summary": "本批修订把助理招聘线统一改成平面事件池承载，并补上对应的主动玩法入口：发布招聘、收到应聘、跟进回复、初聊姿态与录用判断都由 pool 事件串起，不再把这条线写成链式主线。",
          "arc": "开局第一天·主动招聘助理（平面事件池承载）",
          "locations": [
            {
              "id": "job_agency_linh",
              "descr": "县城里常见的招聘服务门店，玻璃门上贴着招工信息，柜台后摆着老旧电脑和打印机。可用于主角线下发布招聘、查看简历、与应聘者初次见面，兼容后续招司机、招财务、招保镖等团队招聘玩法。",
              "prompt": "small county job agency interior in China, glass door with hiring posters, old desktop computers, printer, front desk, realistic modern county town atmosphere, modest office, daytime"
            },
            {
              "id": "office_interview_room",
              "descr": "主角临时用于面试和谈工作的办公室小会议室，比 office_small 更偏接待用途，有一张会议桌、两三把椅子和热水杯，适合招聘初谈、试岗沟通和后续团队小型复盘。",
              "prompt": "small interview meeting room in a modest county office, simple conference table, a few chairs, water cups, bright indoor lighting, realistic contemporary China county business style"
            }
          ],
          "roles": [],
          "items": [],
          "events": [
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_post_style_high",
              "title": "招聘口径：高调撒钱",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player"
              ],
              "location": "job_agency_linh",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "“高薪急招助理，效率第一，待遇不设上限，能立刻到岗最好。”"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "这话一发出去，像是在招人，也像是在告诉全县——${term.player.self_proud}有钱，而且很急着把摊子铺开。"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "",
              "end_script": "// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“高调撒钱”招聘口径，形成后续助理对玩家的第一层预判，并把应聘反馈延后到次日出现。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 作为当前关注度基线；${player.team_zhuli_application_received} 用于避免重复调度首份应聘。\n// 计算规则：高调路线会提升招聘关注度，也更容易让应聘者先入为主地觉得玩家像暴发户老板，因此 first_impression 先写为 -1。\n// 写回变量：style=1，attention 增加，first_impression 设为偏负面但可被后续聊天修正；阶段保持为已发布，并标记已发布招聘；应聘消息改为次日触发。\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 2\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = -1\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\nif (!${player.team_zhuli_application_received}) {\n  invoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_days=1\n}",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            },
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_post_style_regular",
              "title": "招聘口径：务实正规",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player"
              ],
              "location": "job_agency_linh",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "“招聘助理一名，负责日程、对接、资料整理与事务跟进。薪资面议，流程规范，能长期配合优先。”"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "这份文案不花哨，但看起来像真准备做事。"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "",
              "end_script": "// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“务实正规”招聘口径，让助理后续更容易把玩家视为靠谱雇主，并把应聘反馈延后到次日出现。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 作为当前关注度基线；${player.team_zhuli_application_received} 用于避免重复调度首份应聘。\n// 计算规则：务实路线关注度适中，能给应聘者较稳定、较专业的第一感受，因此 first_impression 先写为 1。\n// 写回变量：style=2，attention 小幅增加，first_impression 设为偏正面，并标记已发布招聘；应聘消息改为次日触发。\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 2\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 1\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\nif (!${player.team_zhuli_application_received}) {\n  invoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_days=1\n}",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            },
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_post_style_lowkey",
              "title": "招聘口径：低调试水",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player"
              ],
              "location": "job_agency_linh",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "“短期招聘一位事务协助，工作弹性，先合作看看，合适再长期安排。”"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "这种写法很稳，不容易招来太多闲话，但也容易让人觉得你还没想明白要做什么。"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "",
              "end_script": "// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“低调试水”招聘口径，保留谨慎起步的团队搭建风格，并把应聘反馈延后到次日出现。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 当前关注度基线；${player.team_zhuli_application_received} 用于避免重复调度首份应聘。\n// 计算规则：低调路线外界关注度最低，但也会让优秀应聘者怀疑岗位稳定性，因此 first_impression 先写为 0，表示中性偏观望。\n// 写回变量：style=3，attention 不增加，first_impression 设为中性；阶段保持已发布，并标记已发布招聘；应聘消息改为次日触发。\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 3\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 0\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = 0\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\nif (!${player.team_zhuli_application_received}) {\n  invoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_days=1\n}",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            },
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_zhuli_application",
              "title": "第二天收到一份亮眼应聘",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player",
                "important:zhuli"
              ],
              "location": "job_agency_linh",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "第二天再打开招聘后台时，一条新应聘消息安静地躺在最上面。"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "应聘者的简历利落，履历不算夸张，但一看就不是那种只会端茶倒水的花架子。"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "备注里只有一句话：“如果岗位是真的，今天方便聊聊。”"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "// 规则目的：在招聘发布后的第二天收到助理的应聘消息，只负责把“出现候选人”这一步明确落地，不直接写死录用。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_posted} 确认招聘已发布；${player.team_recruit_stage} 判断当前流程是否已进入候选阶段；${player.team_zhuli_application_received} 用于防止重复收取同一份首轮应聘。\n// 计算规则：该事件仅由上游招聘发布节点以 delay_days=1 调度；只有在已发布招聘且尚未收到过该候选人消息时，才推进到“已收到应聘”。\n// 写回变量：把阶段推进到 2，并记录助理已进入招聘流程，同时开放后续跟进入口。\nif (${player.team_recruit_posted} && !${player.team_zhuli_application_received}) {\n  ${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)\n  ${player.team_zhuli_application_received} = true\n  doing_unlock(\"do_recruit_zhuli_followup_now\")\n  doing_unlock(\"do_recruit_zhuli_followup_check\")\n  doing_unlock(\"do_recruit_zhuli_followup_hold\")\n}",
              "end_script": "",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            },
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_zhuli_reply_now",
              "title": "立刻沟通",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player"
              ],
              "location": "job_agency_linh",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "你没多想，直接点开对话框。"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "“可以，现在聊。”"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "",
              "end_script": "// 规则目的：玩家选择立刻沟通，体现效率导向，并调度初聊节点。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_stage} 用于确认流程已进入收到应聘阶段。\n// 计算规则：response_style 约定为 1立刻沟通、2先看履历、3暂缓处理。立刻沟通会让助理觉得玩家执行快。\n// 写回变量：写入 response_style=1，并直接调度初聊事件。\n${player.team_recruit_response_style} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_first_chat",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            },
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_zhuli_check_resume",
              "title": "先看履历",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player"
              ],
              "location": "job_agency_linh",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "你先把她的履历从头到尾看了一遍。"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "做过前台，也跟过小项目，最重要的是，字里行间透着一股会办事的利索劲。"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "看完之后，你才回了她一句。"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "",
              "end_script": "// 规则目的：玩家先看履历再沟通，体现谨慎与专业感，并调度初聊节点。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} 允许被轻度修正；${player.team_recruit_stage} 用于确认流程阶段。\n// 计算规则：先看履历会让助理感到玩家不是乱招人，因此若初始印象偏负，可轻微拉回；同时进入初聊节点。\n// 写回变量：response_style=2；若 first_impression 小于 1，则加 1；随后调度初聊。\n${player.team_recruit_response_style} = 2\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)\nif (${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} < 1) {\n  ${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = ${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} + 1\n}\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_first_chat",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            },
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_zhuli_hold",
              "title": "暂缓处理",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player"
              ],
              "location": "job_agency_linh",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "你把这条应聘消息先搁在一边。"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "人就在这儿，不急着今天拍板。真想做事的人，不会因为几个小时就跑。"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "",
              "end_script": "// 规则目的：允许玩家暂缓处理，不把招聘链路强制推到底，同时保留后续再次联系空间。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_stage} 当前阶段；${player.team_zhuli_application_received} 记录候选人已出现。\n// 写回变量：response_style=3，阶段仍保持在已收到应聘或更高，不触发录用判断；保留后续回头联系的可能。\n${player.team_recruit_response_style} = 3\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            },
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_zhuli_first_chat",
              "title": "和助理线上初聊",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player",
                "important:zhuli"
              ],
              "location": "office_interview_room",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "第二天傍晚，你把聊工作的地方定在了小会议室。"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "她进门的时候先扫了一眼桌子和椅子，没急着坐，像是在判断你到底是真招人，还是随口试试。"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "“先聊清楚吧，省得后面谁都不舒服。”"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "",
              "end_script": "// 规则目的：在助理应聘后进入第一次正式初聊，只记录过程氛围与管理姿态，不直接写死录用。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_response_style} 用来识别玩家是立刻沟通、先看履历还是暂缓处理；${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} 记录她对玩家的初始印象；${player.team_manage_style} 用于后续录用判断。\n// 计算规则：初聊只是把双方的合作方式摊开，不直接决定入职。若管理姿态明确，会让后续判断更清晰。\n// 写回变量：推进 stage 至 3，表示已完成初聊；并开放后续三种沟通姿态入口。\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 3)\ndoing_unlock(\"do_recruit_zhuli_chat_bold\")\ndoing_unlock(\"do_recruit_zhuli_chat_rules\")\ndoing_unlock(\"do_recruit_zhuli_chat_trial\")",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            },
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_zhuli_chat_bold",
              "title": "沟通姿态：爽快拍板",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player",
                "important:zhuli"
              ],
              "location": "office_interview_room",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "“我这边不绕弯子。你能来，就直接按正式助理来做。”"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "话说得很直，空气也跟着安静了一拍。"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "",
              "end_script": "// 规则目的：管理姿态之一——爽快拍板，体现玩家做事利落，但不强行录用。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_manage_style} 记录管理取向；${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} 作为她对玩家的感受底色。\n// 计算规则：爽快拍板会提升执行感，但也可能让对方感到压迫，因此只做轻量修正，不直接决定录用。\n// 写回变量：team_manage_style=1，并将阶段推进到可录用判断前的完成态之一。\n${player.team_manage_style} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 4)",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            },
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_zhuli_chat_rules",
              "title": "沟通姿态：讲清规则",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player",
                "important:zhuli"
              ],
              "location": "office_interview_room",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "“你先看职责，再谈待遇。活要怎么干，规矩怎么定，我一次讲清。”"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "她抬眼看了看你，像是在重新给你打分。"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "",
              "end_script": "// 规则目的：管理姿态之一——讲清规则，体现县城生意里最稳的合作方式。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_manage_style} 记录管理取向；${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} 记录初印象。\n// 计算规则：把边界、职责、节奏讲明白，会提升信任，但仍不直接写死录用。\n// 写回变量：team_manage_style=2，并将阶段推进到可录用判断前的完成态之一。\n${player.team_manage_style} = 2\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 4)",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            },
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_zhuli_chat_trial",
              "title": "沟通姿态：先试用一天",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player",
                "important:zhuli"
              ],
              "location": "office_interview_room",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "“先别急着把话说满。你先试一天，行不行明天再说。”"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "这话不算豪气，但很实在。"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "",
              "end_script": "// 规则目的：管理姿态之一——先试用一天，保留试错空间，也最符合县城里熟人合作的现实节奏。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_manage_style} 记录管理取向；${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} 记录初印象。\n// 计算规则：试用制会降低双方风险感，尤其适合刚起步团队，因此只推进阶段，不强行定论。\n// 写回变量：team_manage_style=3，并将阶段推进到可录用判断前的完成态之一。\n${player.team_manage_style} = 3\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 4)",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            },
            {
              "collectionType": "pool",
              "id": "recruit_zhuli_hire_decision",
              "title": "录用判断",
              "trigger_mode": "invoke",
              "trigger_expr": "",
              "invoke_params": [],
              "object_keys": [
                "player",
                "important:zhuli"
              ],
              "location": "office_interview_room",
              "presentation": {
                "type": "dialogue",
                "dialogues": [
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "聊到最后，真正的问题还是落在了一个点上：你要不要把她真正留在身边。"
                  },
                  {
                    "speaker_type": "player",
                    "speaker_key": "player",
                    "content": "她没催，只是等你开口。"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "init_script": "",
              "end_script": "",
              "next": [],
              "bgm": ""
            }
          ],
